    "scope": "Job author-tests, sessions slice 1 (A-494), grok, on lane/session-20260922-69 at b7a4cb98. One defect in ops/conductor/tests/fakes/session_tmux.py, found by the builder: main() runs the real tmux through ops.testkit.run and returns only result.exit, so the real tmux's stdout and stderr never reach the caller; `new-window -P -F '#{pane_id}'` and `show-options -qv` read empty under the shim. The docstring says every other argv \"execs the host tmux\". Fix: write result.stdout to stdout and result.stderr to stderr before returning result.exit; keep the call log, the kill-server refusal and the attach no-op. Add one row that proves the shim passes a real tmux format value through (skip with the reason when tmux is absent). Touch nothing else; test_sessions.py is being revised by A-493 in parallel. Walkthrough: the revise-tests walkthrough at f6abe132 holds. Note: the reading, reused: names.\n",
